# ==============================================================================
*.bak
*.tmp
temp/
tmp/
*.orig
.cache/

# ==============================================================================
# Notes
# ==============================================================================
# This file is crucial for Docker build performance:
# - Reduces build context size (smaller COPY operations)
# - Reduces network bandwidth (smaller upload to Docker daemon)
# - Speeds up build cache invalidation (fewer file changes)
# - Improves security (excludes sensitive files like .env)
#
# Example Impact:
# - Without .dockerignore: 500 MB+ build context
# - With .dockerignore: 100 MB build context
# - Build time reduction: ~30-40% faster
#
# Changes to ignored files won't trigger Docker cache invalidation,
# enabling faster local iterations.
